      "content": "i don't know if i want to be that \"honest\" version of myself though. it's so much harder. they're going to look at me with so much pity and it's gonna hurt more than the failure itself. i just keep thinking... wouldn't it be easier if they just remembered me the way i was? before i messed everything up?",
